# Defensive: never commit private signing material from this directory.
# Private keys live in ~/.soth/keys/release/ on operator machines and
# in 1Password as the source of truth. See ops/keys/README.md.
#
# Note: the root .gitignore blocks `*.pem` globally. We re-allow public
# keys here so they ship with the binary (baked in via include_bytes!).
!*.public.pem
*.private.pem
*.private.der
*.private.key
*.pem.encrypted
